 "body": {
  "html": "<p style=\"color:#5f6368;\">Your Name<br>Street Address<br>City, Postcode</p><p><br></p><p>Recipient Name<br>Company<br>Street Address<br>City, Postcode</p><p><br></p><p>Date</p><p><br></p><p>Dear Recipient,</p><p>Open with why you are writing, in one sentence.</p><p>Use the middle paragraphs for the detail: what you are asking for, what you are offering, and anything the reader needs in order to act.</p><p>Close by saying what should happen next and by when.</p><p><br></p><p>Yours sincerely,</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Your Name</p>",
